WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.426 --> 00:00:03.682
Unit one. Parts of a Computer!

2
00:00:04.593 --> 00:00:10.100
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:13.840
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:18.156
Today we learn about Parts of a Computer. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.847 --> 00:00:22.747
Monitor. Say it with me. Monitor!

6
00:00:26.275 --> 00:00:30.558
Hard drive. Say it with me. Hard drive!

7
00:00:34.054 --> 00:00:37.803
Speaker. Say it with me. Speaker!

8
00:00:41.313 --> 00:00:45.678
Microphone. Say it with me. Microphone!

9
00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.201
Charger. Say it with me. Charger!

10
00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:00.461
Battery. Say it with me. Battery!

11
00:01:03.968 --> 00:01:07.996
Device. Say it with me. Device!

12
00:01:11.496 --> 00:01:15.541
Hardware. Say it with me. Hardware!

13
00:01:19.025 --> 00:01:34.235
A monitor shows me the screen, and the hard drive stores my files. A speaker lets me hear sound, and a microphone lets me talk to the device. A charger fills the battery, and all these parts are called hardware.

14
00:01:34.285 --> 00:01:37.496
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:38.247 --> 00:01:43.774
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:43.824 --> 00:01:44.974
Speaker!

17
00:01:45.913 --> 00:01:51.422
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:51.472 --> 00:01:52.622
Device!

19
00:01:53.683 --> 00:02:00.254
Did you know? A hard drive can store thousands of photos, songs, and games all at once!

20
00:02:00.304 --> 00:02:02.721
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:03.571 --> 00:02:12.870
Think and answer. Name two parts of a computer and what they do.

22
00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:14.194
Great answer!

23
00:02:15.133 --> 00:02:20.755
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:20.805 --> 00:02:24.070
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

